"h": "5. Data Quality, Reconciliation & Lineage",
"md": "\nGates G0, G1 and G3 are row-level and run per micro-batch. G2, G4 and G5 are set-level aggregates and run at the EOD gate only — running them per box is 288 full passes a day. G6 is the outbound gate and blocks a submission rather than warning.",
